                                "sense_id": "fe47a46f-0530-34c0-9726-3c003ee1730f",
                                "text": "Even though some names or words polysemically carry sexual meanings, this does not automatically mean that every usage of them in literary texts, even those of a pornographic nature, has a sexual meaning, either explicitly or punningly."
